@40100000 = ~Install Defender kit~ //Install Kit
@40100001 = ~defender~ //Lower Case Kit Name
@40100002 = ~Defender~ //Mixed Case Kit Name
@40100003 = ~DEFENDER: A member of a special sect within the druidic order, a Druid of this type is dedicated to preserving those who would protect nature. At the expense of some of <PRO_HISHER> druidic talents, a Defender has come into communion with the deities of the natural world to gain special abilities and rituals.
	
Advantages:
- +2 bonus to Strength, Dexterity and Constitution
- Seven cleric spells are added to <PRO_HISHER> repertoire, all the way up to 7th level. These are listed below:
 1st level: Sanctuary
 2nd level: Aid
 3rd level: Remove Paralysis
 4th level: Lesser Restoration
 5th level: Raise Dead
 6th level: Bolt of Glory
 7th level: Greater Restoration
 
Disadvantages:
- Cannot use Shapeshift.
- May not use scimitars, daggers, spears or darts.~ //Kit Description
@40100004 = ~DEFENDER: A member of a special sect within the druidic order, a Druid of this type is dedicated to preserving those who would protect nature. At the expense of some of <PRO_HISHER> druidic talents, a Defender has come into communion with the deities of the natural world to gain special abilities and rituals.

Advantages:
- +2 bonus to Strength, Dexterity and Constitution

Disadvantages:
- Cannot use Shapeshift.
- May not use scimitars, daggers, spears or darts.

  Sphere Access
  - Major access to the sphere(s) of All, Animal, Elemental, Healing, Necromantic (restorative only), Plant, Sun, Weather
  - Minor access to the sphere(s) of Protection
  - No access to the sphere(s) of Astral, Chaos, Charm, Combat, Creation, Divination, Guardian, Law, Necromantic, Numbers, Protection, Summoning, Thought, Time, Travelers, War, Wards.~ //Kit Description: Divine Remix - Spheres